**Miho.** A runaway military android who just wants to live an
ordinary life. Built as a self-aware war machine by the Malicron
Corporation, Miho escaped when her creators tried to reclaim her by
force, critically damaged. She was found and repaired by a young
inventor, Braun, and has stayed by his side ever since, hoping to live
a normal, human life despite her origins. Innocent, kind-hearted, and
eager to learn everything she can about the world, Miho wants nothing
more than to help -- even if her enormous strength and destructive
potential sometimes make that harder than it should be. *Agile +3,
Attack (Robo-Powered Arsenal) +3, Beautiful +3, Combat Expert +3,
Heightened Sense (Sight) +3, Life Support +3, Quick +3, Strong +3,
Transformation +1, Unique Ability (Quick Calculator) +1; Bizarre
Appearance (Robot Features) -1, Dependency (Sun) -3, Guardian (Braun)
-2, Ineptitude (Cooking) -2, Kind-Hearted -2, Naive -2, Trigger
(Transformation If Critical) -2, Unique Weakness (Excessive Density)
-1, Vulnerability (Electricity) -3, Wanted (Malicron Corporation) -3.*
Mode 1: Hand-to-Hand (Affinity: Martial Arts): Roll 8, DX 7, End 0.
Even barehanded, Miho is a competent combatant. Mode 2: Gatling Gun
(Overwhelming, Ranged; Inaccurate x3): Roll 5, DX 4, End 0. She's
packin'! The more bullets, the better! Mode 3: Missile Launcher (Area
Effect, Ranged, Stunning; Delayed, Inaccurate x3): Roll 5, DX 4,
End 0. Speak softly and launch a big missile! Mode 4: Sniper Rifle
(Accurate, Armor Piercing, Impairing, Ranged; Concentration: Aiming):
Roll 9, DX 4, End 0. Miho takes them out with robotic precision. Mode
SP: Miho Ray (Effective x6, Ranged; Requirement: Self-Preservation
Mode (-20)): Roll 10, DX 10, End 10. Nothing will remain to hurt her.
Defense 5. Health 40, Endurance 40. TV 20.

**Transformation.** Grants: Combat Expert +2, Endurance Reserve +2;
Unique Weakness (Loss of Control) -3.

